---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { FIRST_CALL_NET_PAY, firstCallCurl } from '../lib/first-call.js';

const curl = firstCallCurl('https://takehome.gautamkhosla.com');
---

<Base title="API docs — Takehome">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>API docs</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Get a key, make one authenticated call, see <code>{FIRST_CALL_NET_PAY}</code>.
      Test keys run the same engine as live keys and are not metered.
    </p>

    <ol>
      <li>
        <a href="/signup/">Get a key</a> — email, verify, copy the
        <code>np_test_</code> key. No sales call.
      </li>
      <li>
        Run the first call. Ontario weekly <code>$1000.00</code> on
        <code>2026-01-15</code>, claim code 1. <code>employee.net_pay</code>
        is <code>{FIRST_CALL_NET_PAY}</code>.
      </li>
    </ol>

    <pre><code>{curl}</code></pre>

    <p>
      Replace <code>np_test_YOUR_KEY</code> with the test key from verify.
      Public listings (<code>/v1/rules</code>, <code>/v1/jurisdictions</code>,
      <code>/openapi.json</code>) do not need a key.
    </p>
    <p>
      Live keys count calculations, not HTTP requests, and stop at the plan
      limit. Prices are on <a href="/pricing/">pricing</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      Job boards can skip the API: one
      <a href="/embed/"><code>embed.js</code></a> tag runs the same WASM engine
      in the listing page. No cookie, no salary posted back.
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>
